      "id": "claim_e675430210c94db09e65fcdfeb7b20db",
      "statement": "To completely switch off the default web application security configuration, including Actuator security, or to combine multiple Spring Security components such as OAuth2 Client and Resource Server, add a bean of type SecurityFilterChain (doing so does not disable the UserDetailsService configuration). To also switch off the UserDetailsService configuration, add a bean of type UserDetailsService, AuthenticationProvider, or AuthenticationManager.",
